  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">/ Training Nurses - Training District nurses</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">/Sjuksk&#xf6;ter.utb.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kompetensen inom och spridningen av f&#xf6;rebyggande h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd genom att involvera distriktssk&#xf6;terskor i h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rdsarbete. Att uppm&#xe4;rksamma distriktssk&#xf6;terskornas viktiga roll i detta arbete st&#xe4;rker det nuvarande &#xe4;nnu relativt outvecklade systemet av preventiv h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd. Seminarier f&#xf6;r 30 distriktssk&#xf6;t. fr&#xe5;n 15 distrikt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to enhance the competence in the field of health promotion among district nurses in Estonia and in so doing reinforcing the development of an infrastructure of health promotion throughout Estonia. A train the trainer&apos;s seminar series for 30 head nurses from the 15 counties will be conducted.</narrative>
  </description>
